				<p class="pos">noun (software engineering, AI systems)</p>
				<p>
					A lightweight, embeddable software agent injected into an existing application,
					typically via a browser bookmarklet or extension. It enhances the host application with
					autonomous or semi-autonomous capabilities such as automation, AI, analytics, or UX
					augmentation, without requiring backend changes.
